  "caption_draft": "Evaluation pipeline. Crops from two open-access collections (60 works each, four media) receive six procedural losses. Every model sees the same input, with the hole expanded to whole 8x8 cells (a); diffusion models use a stated prefill (b); generated pixels are kept only in the original hole and scored against the recorded crop, and planned, scored and withheld conditions are counted per model (c). Coloured parts are the protocol controls.",
